 # ComicCraft — Brainstorming & Ideation

 ## 1\. Core Product Idea

 **ComicCraft** is an AI-powered web application that transforms a user's simple idea into a complete comic story using **Gemini models**.

 ### One-line concept

 > **“From a simple idea to a complete comic in minutes.”**

 The user provides an idea such as:

 > “A 15-year-old student discovers a robot hidden underneath his school.”

 ComicCraft turns it into:

 - Comic title
- Story premise
- Characters
- Character personalities
- Story chapters/pages
- Individual comic panels
- Dialogue
- Narration
- Scene descriptions
- Visual prompts
- Cover concept

 The important product idea is that **AI handles the creative heavy lifting while the user remains the director/editor.**

