 # 3\. Main User Problem

 Creating a comic normally requires several different skills:

```
Story idea
    ↓
Writing
    ↓
Character development
    ↓
Script writing
    ↓
Panel planning
    ↓
Artwork
    ↓
Dialogue placement
    ↓
Page layout
    ↓
Editing
```

 For beginners, this can feel overwhelming.

 ### ComicCraft's solution

```
                    USER IDEA
                       ↓
                 ┌─────────────┐
                 │  ComicCraft │
                 │     AI      │
                 └─────────────┘
                       ↓
        ┌──────────────┼──────────────┐
        ↓              ↓              ↓
     STORY        CHARACTERS       PANELS
        ↓              ↓              ↓
     DIALOGUE       VISUALS       LAYOUT
        └──────────────┼──────────────┘
                       ↓
                 COMPLETE COMIC
```

