 # 7\. User-Controlled AI

 A major design principle should be:

 > **AI suggests. The creator decides.**

 Instead of automatically changing everything, ComicCraft should provide controls such as:

 - ✨ Generate
- 🔄 Regenerate
- ✏️ Edit
- ➕ Expand
- ✂️ Shorten
- 🎭 Change tone
- 💬 Rewrite dialogue
- 🎨 Change visual style
- ➡️ Continue story

 This makes the application feel collaborative rather than fully automated.

