 # 13\. Gemini Structured Story Model

 One important technical/product decision is to **separate story data from visual rendering**.

 Instead of Gemini returning one giant piece of text, ComicCraft should internally represent a comic like:

```
Comic
 ├── metadata
 ├── characters[]
 ├── pages[]
 │    ├── panels[]
 │    │    ├── scene
 │    │    ├── dialogue[]
 │    │    ├── caption
 │    │    ├── emotion
 │    │    └── visualPrompt
 │    └── layout
 └── style
```

 This will make editing much easier.

