 # 15\. Another Strong Feature — Story Consistency

 AI-generated stories can suffer from characters changing personality or appearance.

 ComicCraft could maintain a **Story Bible**.

```
STORY BIBLE

Character:
Arjun

Age:
16

Personality:
Curious, brave, sarcastic

Appearance:
Black hair, blue jacket, backpack

Important:
Never describe Arjun as an adult.

World:
Modern Chennai

Tone:
Adventure + comedy
```

 Every subsequent Gemini request receives the relevant story context.

 This helps maintain continuity across pages and future chapters.

